{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://uutils.org",
    "description": [
      "将每个 FILE 的最后 10 行打印到标准输出"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--bytes",
      "alias": [
        "-c"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-c, --bytes <BYTES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "要打印的字节数"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--debug",
      "tip": [
        "指示使用了哪种 --follow 实现"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--follow",
      "alias": [
        "-f"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "--follow[=<FOLLOW>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "随文件增长打印文件"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "descriptor"
        },
        {
          "name": "name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--lines",
      "alias": [
        "-n"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-n, --lines <LINES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "要打印的行数"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-unchanged-stats",
      "usage": [
        "--max-unchanged-stats <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "FILE 大小在 N（默认 5）次迭代后未变时重新打开，以确认其是否被取消链接或重命名（轮转日志文件的常见情况）；此选项仅在轮询（即使用 --use-polling）且 --follow=name 时有意义"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--pid",
      "usage": [
        "--pid <PID>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "与 -f 合用，进程 ID（PID）消亡后终止"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--quiet",
      "alias": [
        "-q"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-q, --quiet"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "从不输出给出文件名的标头"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--retry",
      "tip": [
        "文件不可访问时继续尝试打开"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--sleep-interval",
      "alias": [
        "-s"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-s, --sleep-interval <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "与 -f 合用轮询文件时每次休眠的秒数"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--use-polling",
      "tip": [
        "禁用 inotify 支持，改用轮询"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--verbose",
      "alias": [
        "-v"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-v, --verbose"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "始终输出给出文件名的标头"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "alias": [
        "-V"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-V, --version"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印版本"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--zero-terminated",
      "alias": [
        "-z"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-z, --zero-terminated"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "行分隔符为 NUL 而非换行"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-F",
      "tip": [
        "等同于 --follow=name --retry"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "alias": [
        "-h"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-h, --help"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印帮助"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
